    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SLIPONE\n-\n3\nThe Philippine Clipper\nSUNDI ANO",
      "\"Philippine Clipper,\" sister ship of Pan American\nAirways\n\"China Clipper\"\n*Hawaii Chpper\nin fight over San Francisco Bay. These ships take\noff from Alameda every Wednesday for Manila,\n8200 miles away. Land every Tuesday at Alameda.\nAccess to the air base is open to the public.\nPOST CARD\nTHIS SPACE FOR ADDRESS ONLY\nPLACE\nONE CENT\nSTAMP\nHERE\n2124"
    ],
